10	 * ciphertext via OpenSSL using the AVX optimized code path. It also decrypts 
11	 * the ciphertext and verifies that it matches the original plaintext. The 
12	 * ciphertext, MAC, and decrypted data are compared against pre-computed 
13	 * golden values on every iteration to detect silent data corruption.
14	 * @endparblock
15	 */
